        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-mw96kqoe-lg4q4klwz6",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Arrive at El Dorado Airport in Bogotá, where an English-speaking guide will meet you. Then transfer to your hotel and check in.\n\nThe rest of the day is yours. After the flight, you can rest or explore the nearby streets on your own. The evening gives you time to get a first feel for Bogotá at an easy pace. The city is the starting point for the trip, and the next two days focus on the history of the capital and its surroundings."
